Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妝會不會太濃了點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為很久沒露面了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎回來  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出差感覺怎樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  還行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個是給你們倆的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長他們不在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.41,0:00:40.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  和政府的高官們開會去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:41.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.86,0:00:43.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本想跟他們打聲招呼的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  那是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎  怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.53,0:01:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了  賢木
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.73,0:01:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,透視看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.87,0:01:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛多生恨  被奪走的未來？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.22,0:01:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的！燃燒！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.22,0:01:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(691.,660)}Burning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.17,0:01:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.26,0:01:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百鍊自得之極致
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.26,0:01:33.97,zhushi,zhushi,0,0,0,,（出自網球王子）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒搞錯運動吧  還有雜誌也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:46.42,zhushi,zhushi,0,0,0,,（網王是《周刊少年Jump》，可憐是《周刊少年Sunday》）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太平啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.83,0:01:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是本部發來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.77,0:01:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先暫停
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.94,0:02:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急事態  B.A.B.E.L總部被襲擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請立即跟影Child替換
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.37,0:02:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,襲擊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖攻擊的主犯是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個…根據情報
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,據說是皆本主任
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並不覺得有什麼異常
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.59,0:02:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.09,0:02:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這全都是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.65,0:02:30.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本干的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本似乎趁著爆炸產生的混亂逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然已經派人搜索  但還沒查到他的行蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是哪裡搞錯了  他怎麼可能會做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也不相信  但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學校那邊暫時交給影Child
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在有指示前留在自己家中待機
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不用擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:02:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那肯定是冒牌的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:00.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  以前不也有過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個不可思議的筆記事件中  兵部少佐偽裝成皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼這次也是京介做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼殘忍的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗  你也說兩句啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  這輛車在向哪裡開啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本這混蛋  難道…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長  這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.52,0:03:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會讓你得逞的  不會讓你得逞的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.31,0:03:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆…皆本這混帳  居然設下這麼恐怖的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通人的話可就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  這到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:53.29,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,（DEATH）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳皆本  難道…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  超能力用不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.61,0:04:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是ECM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下  你到底是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要吸  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡！快開門！快開門！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作點  喂  能聽到我的聲音嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很害怕吧  沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:31.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  你還是和以前一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那果然不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來  站起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.41,0:04:37.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還能跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡好像是富士野吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  B.A.B.E.L裡有內鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被他們陷害了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵和紫穗還在他們手裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:04:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可原諒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他們了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.49,0:05:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  去制伏他們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:10.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘗我這招  念動力大迴轉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(656,660)}Pyschic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我出來  你這個叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵和紫穗在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰  好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.35,0:05:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騙人的  騙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真了不起  薰  做的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是只能給70分啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得好好了結了她們才是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:59.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣折磨她們太可憐了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們不是你無以代替的摯友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼呢  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太美了  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那因絕望而扭曲的哭相
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您喜歡嗎  女王
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Phantom Daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫她女王？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  讓她看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你重生後的身姿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了吧  他已經成為我的新人偶了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名叫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暗黑騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴我這是騙人的  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遊戲才剛剛開始  你好好享受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才所說的女王是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:06.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我必須保護的人的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把我當成是女王了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:16.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我看看吧  你最脆弱的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放在心底不想讓任何人知道的傷痕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要抓住那個的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不許動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破壞女王
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想開槍打你…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你其實是想這麼做的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:52.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是屬於我女王的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括你的身心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.63,0:08:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有這個男人在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說不定能成為和薰一樣的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.27,0:08:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…誰能把這個翻譯成英文？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.03,0:08:24.12,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs20}This is our new episode,allowed by the author.\NThis is not something the animation staff decided to make on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.03,0:08:24.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這集是作者允許製作的  這不是動畫的製作人員擅自決定的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:28.90,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs20}Do you think something is wrong with the animation?\NNo,this is fresh of the lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你認為這動畫有什麼問題嗎？不  這是新的路線
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.95,0:08:32.48,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs20}In fact,extra attention is being paid to the production work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.95,0:08:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事實上  製品工作上已經給了特別的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:37.48,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs20}Depending on the sales of the OVA,there is a possibility of a second series.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根據OVA的銷售情況  有可能製作第二季
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:40.40,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs20}To realize that,we need to sell 20,000 copies...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了實現這一點  我們需要銷售兩萬張
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,STOP！STOP！這就夠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.47,0:08:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明石她是不是吃錯東西了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  你不覺得她們很可疑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:50.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺像是人偶一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們兩個的情況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:57.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體基本上都恢復了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不知道是不是因為精神上受到的打擊太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.91,0:09:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到現在意識都還沒有恢復
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.11,0:09:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之不要讓她們在一個地方久留
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓皆本知道薰的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.59,0:09:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰不要緊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也難怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連我也是到現在還不能相信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.03,0:09:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本居然變成那樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵  紫穗  真的對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  我還是回本部比較…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.25,0:09:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很迷人  你穿泳衣的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:09:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來接你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.78,0:10:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放手  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要害怕  來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.07,0:10:10.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離開小薰  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢木  怎麼了  居然用那種東西指著我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別再耍猴戲了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢…賢木醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從水裡上來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把雙手和兩膝貼到地板上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反抗的話我就開槍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是恐嚇…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:31.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你開槍啊  立刻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.51,0:10:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是天真
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.97,0:10:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我很喜歡你這點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.41,0:10:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再痛苦點吧  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.03,0:10:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來很好玩嘛  加我一份吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是皆本讓你改變了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過度的野心是會引火燒身的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開玩笑  你要能阻止我的話就試試啊  老爺子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我給你唱搖籃曲聽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫且撤退吧  騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.52,0:11:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.33,0:11:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你來…幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我恭敬點  你這江湖醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:53.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這已經不僅僅是你們B.A.B.E.L的問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:12:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了  第二季要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  第二季Start
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到會在這本部…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  沒想到會有自己請兵部來的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們兩個快點醒過來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預知那件事你知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.48,0:12:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點點
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.19,0:12:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個預想發生了異變
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詳細的情況不能告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是在未來Phantom Daughter有可能取代女王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.03,0:12:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.87,0:12:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掌握關鍵的正是  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的存在創造了新的女王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會吧  難道沒有什麼辦法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  你只能用自己的雙手來奪回自己的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奪回女王的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.53,0:12:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為此…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:57.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:13:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能殺了皆本  用你自己的手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天早上都這麼費心費力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐似乎在B.A.B.E.L
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然真木先生讓我們不要去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:15.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色的又是羊栖菜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明明說過討厭羊栖菜的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好慢啊  你去哪裡買茶了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.52,0:13:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.83,0:13:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,駕到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妄自尊大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.55,0:13:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從今天開始你們就是我的僕人了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…雖然這只是我的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要從那強烈的洗腦中把皆本拯救出來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  我們不能答應
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什麼證據證明你沒有別的圖謀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們超能力者的未來就會被黑色幽靈奪走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.82,0:13:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  兵部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:13:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眾多的超能力者將飽受苦難
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能阻止這一切的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.97,0:14:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  只有你這個真正的女王
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.89,0:14:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王  女王的  都說我不是了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.47,0:14:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪  還有…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玉置和火野被Phantom Daughter控制了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個傢伙自稱是女王
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.43,0:14:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢木  薰  請速來作戰室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本發來了通訊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為女王需要很多朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.33,0:14:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  到我們身邊來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定能成為女王最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋  笨蛋  笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,zhushi,zhushi,0,0,0,,（喂喂，釘宮就在你旁邊）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.11,0:15:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王不是你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就任由他們胡鬧嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.73,0:15:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的話我們聽到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.87,0:15:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經不想再看這樣的皆本了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.11,0:15:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.89,0:15:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放手去做吧  有我們在你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次我們絕對不會再失敗了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要讓皆本清醒過來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.94,0:15:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要我的話  你就自己過來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…才是女王
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪邊才是真的  讓我們來做個了結吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個壞孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.55,0:15:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我馬上就來  你在那邊等我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把性命交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光榮之至
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長  我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全局進入迎敵狀態！皆本要來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來  開槍吧  請隨便
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家退下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們來對付他們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.02,0:16:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別扯我後腿哦  腹黑女
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.22,0:16:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我的台詞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玉置  火野  陪他們玩玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.55,0:16:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別想跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬間移動的就是你的火
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.18,0:16:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雙重瞬移拳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:16:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒吧  玉置
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手榴彈！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這叫聲東擊西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還太嫩了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局內的ECM都被無效化了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人似乎用了ECCM
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,D小隊被催眠能力者壓制了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs26\pos(610.,660)}Hypno
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.74,0:17:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他們引誘上屋頂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.45,0:17:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按計劃進行中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣就好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.57,0:17:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家無論如何不要丟了性命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然又是個冒牌貨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人在作壁上觀嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王就該如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在前線戰鬥  是騎士和士卒的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.14,0:17:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你認為我只是個棋子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:17:58.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王在屋頂等你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對你而言的女王而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.65,0:18:21.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我看看吧  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那因絕望而扭曲的臉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要來打擾我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.93,0:18:35.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰  快了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本馬上就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好  要是覺得不妙就…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到這邊來  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次的洗腦解除  跟巴雷特和提姆那時不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:17.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關鍵是那兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:21.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  不能跟女神和女帝一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:24.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須讓女王單獨面對
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這種距離用Blaster的話肯定能殺死我吧  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  那就是讓時間停止的魔法槍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.54,0:19:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道嗎  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要說了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.48,0:19:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…很喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要說了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愛你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:19:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住口！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:02.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.71,0:20:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,降落到屋頂  快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感應器收到皆本心跳停止的信號  腦波也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.81,0:20:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.47,0:20:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了解除洗腦竟然走險
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.36,0:20:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為我們所用的皆本已經毀滅了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.62,0:20:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們被將軍了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.58,0:20:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  我們在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.87,0:20:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.37,0:21:01.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:02.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢木醫生！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰你先讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.03,0:21:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  睜開眼睛啊  喂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是為了這個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是為了女王你…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別廢話了  集中精力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了  江湖醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.26,0:21:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我回來  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.88,0:21:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.05,0:21:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.47,0:21:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰…？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:21:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像做了個噩夢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.75,0:22:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我成為了黑色女王的棋子…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傷害了B.A.B.E.L的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.25,0:22:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你讓我清醒了過來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.84,0:22:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是真正的女王…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.20,0:22:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是什麼女王
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.24,0:22:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是Children
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.81,0:22:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永遠都是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.39,0:22:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不許偷跑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.52,0:22:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰你太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.88,0:22:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  紫穗你幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等啊  京介
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.53,0:22:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就回去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  今天就這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.03,0:22:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣她離女王又前進了一步
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰以稱自己是超能力者的女王而最終救了皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.27,0:22:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救了普通人的他
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.26,0:22:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也許
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.89,0:22:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她拯救的不只是我們超能力者的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:57.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.53,0:23:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.39,0:23:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們回去囉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.49,0:23:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過真的嚇死我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.81,0:23:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  你真是好強硬啊  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.82,0:23:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼我需要你…然後就這麼抱住了我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.74,0:23:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生了什麼事  在我們昏迷的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.86,0:23:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…我也記不太清了…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.28,0:23:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人真狡猾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.54,0:23:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.61,0:23:26.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下可要…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,調教一番了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.02,0:23:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂…住手！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--ED--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,☆Seventh★Heaven☆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,ザ·チルドレン starring 平野綾＆白石涼子＆戸松遙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,作詞：六ツ見純代/作曲：okky/編曲：前口渋
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:34.24,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,予鈴のチャイム  アセってDash！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.37,0:23:37.34,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,すべりこみセーフの朝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.48,0:23:40.44,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,ほんのりリップ  チェリーの香り
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:43.61,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,ちょっと甘めで  いいかな？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.76,0:23:46.66,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,お昼休みの  Girl's talk
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:49.77,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,今日もアナタで満載
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.93,0:23:52.96,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,常にオトメは成長期です
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.08,0:23:56.11,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,お見逃しなく  一瞬を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.27,0:24:01.49,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,胸の奥で揺れている
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.66,0:24:05.21,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,こんな  くすぐったい想いこそ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.33,0:24:07.49,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,青春なんです
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:34.24,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,預備鈴的鐘聲中  焦急地Dash!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.37,0:23:37.34,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,滑壘成功的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.48,0:23:40.44,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,一點點口紅  透出櫻桃的香氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:43.61,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,些許的甜美  不要緊吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.76,0:23:46.66,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,午休時間的  Girl's talk
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:49.77,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,今天講的也全都是你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.93,0:23:52.96,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,少女一直都處在成長期
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.08,0:23:56.11,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,請一瞬也  不要眨眼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.27,0:24:01.49,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,心底深處搖曳著的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.66,0:24:05.21,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,微微騷動的情感
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.33,0:24:07.49,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,就是所謂青春
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.62,0:24:10.86,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,DOKI DOKIが止まらない
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.98,0:24:12.96,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,もっと知りたいの
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.02,0:24:14.70,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,アナタを
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.89,0:24:19.74,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,夢中な気持ちをRockして！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.97,0:24:23.16,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,うけとめて  絶対！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.41,0:24:25.34,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,アナタだけと行く
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:27.22,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,☆Seventh★Heaven☆
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.40,0:24:30.59,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,昨日とはまた違う
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.74,0:24:33.77,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,微笑を見せてあげる
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.86,0:24:37.92,ED-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,We'll make your dreams come true
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.62,0:24:10.86,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,內心怦怦亂跳  無法停止
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.98,0:24:12.96,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,想要了解
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.02,0:24:14.70,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,更多的你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.89,0:24:19.74,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,讓熱衷的心情Rock起來!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.97,0:24:23.16,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,請務必接受!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.41,0:24:25.34,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,只跟你一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:27.22,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,☆第七★天堂☆
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.40,0:24:30.59,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,比起昨天又有不同
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.74,0:24:33.77,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你看見微笑的我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.86,0:24:37.92,ED-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會讓你夢想成真
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--in--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.75,0:17:55.18,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,不確かな未来  ブレだしたリアル
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:18:00.08,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,透視（よ）みきれない  時代の混沌（カオス）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:04.82,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,正義や勇気は  諸刃の剣さ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:09.37,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,理想（ゆめ）なんて  覚めるもの
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:13.92,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,奪われた時を戻して
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:18.01,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,大切な愛しさは渡さない
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.17,0:18:20.53,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,かけがえない
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:23.46,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,たったひとり
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:27.67,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,手に負えない情熱が眠らない
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:30.09,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,心は今
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:33.04,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,…Out of control…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:37.88,in-JPN,NTP,0,0,0,,この世の果てまで
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.75,0:17:55.18,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,不可知的未來  模糊不清卻真實
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:18:00.08,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,無法透視  時代的混沌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:04.82,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,正義和勇氣  是雙刃劍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:09.37,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,讓所謂理想  得以覺醒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:13.92,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,讓被奪走的時光復原
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:18.01,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,最重要的愛絕不出讓
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.17,0:18:20.53,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,無可取代
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:23.46,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,獨一無二
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:27.67,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,難以承受的熱情無法澆滅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:30.09,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,如今心已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:33.04,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,…不受控制…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:37.88,in-CHT,NTP,0,0,0,,直到世界終結

